// ## 1. Protocol

// Three sequential invocations of the single-run tick (external-scheduler
// model — no in-process loop). Stdout captured per tick as the verdict
// stream; .fleet-state.txt snapshotted after each tick as the state doc.

// ## 2. Per-tick results

// | Tick | Lines | Lock | Sections | alerts | Exit |
// |------|-------|------|----------|--------|------|
